      "source": {"kind": "legacy_record", "file": "D3TXT02.TXT", "record": 49},
      "evidence": {"level": "D3", "source_kind": "data_file", "source": "D3TXT02.TXT", "address_space": "record", "address": "49", "consumer": "temporary_role item return praise", "doc": "docs/82-romaly-king-production-trace.md"}
    },
    {
      "id": "dq3:text.romaly.king.forced_offer",
      "value": "*「如何? 代替我\n統治這個國家好嗎?",
